simple storage service
----------------------
1) Public access Enable
2) ACL Enable  (At bucket Level)
3) ACL need to enable object Level
access can be provide to the object 

policies will be written in the form of json format
providing the public access for the object inside the bucket
    {
        "Version": "2012-10-17",
        "Id": "PutObjPolicy",
        "Statement": [
            {
                "Sid": "DenyObjectsThatAreNotSSEKMS",
                "Effect": "Allow",
                "Principal": "*",
                "Action": "s3:GetObject",
                "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::s3-flm-vijay/Azure_Administrator_Associate.pdf"
            },
            {
                "Sid": "DenyObjectsThatAreNotSSEKMS1",
                "Effect": "Allow",
                "Principal": "*",
                "Action": "s3:GetObject",
                "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::s3-flm-vijay/cfffc84b-76d8-4033-be39-0438c4de6e6b.pdf"
            }
        ]
    }

